{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54110","headline":"灵鳗井 · 宗亮","name":"灵鳗井","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"散尽残云碧甃开，灵鱼石缝露星腮。\n寒生镜底长清浅，泉脉流从印土来。\n（同前。\n又见同书卷五引吴越释赞宁开宝五年撰《护塔灵鳗菩萨传》引）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宗亮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54110.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54110","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}